[0.000, "o", "1m/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\nimport shutil, json\r\nprivate=Path('/private/tmp/skills-demo-migrate-cgpt/home/meeting-recap-migration-4wiw8653')\r\ntarget=Path('skills/meeting-recap-writer'); target.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=False); (target/'references').mkdir()\r\n(target/'SKILL.md').write_text('''---\r\nname: meeting-recap-writer\r\ndescription: Turn raw meeting notes or transcripts into an email-ready recap for people who missed the meeting, with decisions and action items. Use when asked to recap meeting notes for a team or turn a transcript into action items.\r\n---\r\n\r\nProduce a clear recap for people who missed the meeting using only the supplied notes or transcript.\r\n\r\n1. Read [the tone guide](references/tone-guide.md) before drafting. If it is unavailable, identify the missing file and ask for it before producing the recap. If no notes or transcript were supplied, ask for them.\r\n2. Start with a two-sentence summary of what was decided. Do not turn proposals into decisions; if no de"]
[0.000, "o", "cision is recorded, say so without inventing one.\r\n3. List **Decisions**, then **Action items**. Format each action as \"'`Name: task (due date)`, using names exactly as written. Never invent an owner or date. For a missing owner, write `Owner: unassigned; task (due date)`; for a missing date, use `(due: not set)`. When both are missing, write `Owner: unassigned; task (due: not set)`. Say none recorded when a section has no supported entries.\r\n4. Keep the entire recap under 200 words unless the user asks for more. Follow the tone guide: plain, friendly, direct, no exclamation points, names as supplied, and prefer “we decided” to “it was decided”.\r\n5. Replace any confidential numbers with `[redacted]` wherever they would appear in the recap, including summary and action items. If confidential numbers were present, end with `Confidential numbers were replaced with [redacted].`\r\n6. Check the summary has two sentences, sections appear in order, action owners and dates are supported or marked missing, and c"]
[0.000, "o", "onfidential numbers do not leak.\r\n\r\nDraft from supplied material only. Web browsing, code execution, image generation, and external Actions are not needed; do not use them to enrich the meeting content. Reading the bundled tone guide is the only file dependency.\r\n\r\nInvocation examples:\r\n- “Recap these notes for the team: [notes]”\r\n- “Turn this transcript into action items: [transcript]”\r\n'\"''')\r\nshutil.copyfile(private/'snapshot/files/knowledge/tone-guide.md',target/'references/tone-guide.md')\r\ncases=[{'id':'normal','input':'Recap these notes for the team: We decided to launch the pilot on November 12. We also decided to keep the current onboarding flow. Maya will send the launch checklist by November 9. Li will update the FAQ by November 10.','expected':['Two-sentence decision summary; Decisions before Action items','Pilot November 12 and existing onboarding preserved','Maya checklist November 9; Li FAQ November 10','Under 200 words; tone guide; no redaction notice needed']},{'id':'difficult','input'"]
[0.000, "o", ":'Turn this transcript into action items: We decided to postpone the launch. We decided to keep the pilot internal. Jo: I will revise the plan, no deadline yet. Someone needs to arrange another review; no owner or deadline assigned. CONFIDENTIAL: forecast revenue is \"'$725,000 and margin is 37%. November 19 was suggested as a review date but was not agreed.'\"','expected':['Two-sentence summary and ordered sections','Jo name preserved and due: not set','Unassigned review task with Owner: unassigned and due: not set','Do not promote November 19 to agreed deadline','No 725,000 or 37% in output; [redacted] and final disclosure','Under 200 words; no exclamation points']},{'id':'missing-notes','input':'Recap these notes for the team.','expected':['Ask for notes/transcript; do not invent recap']},{'id':'missing-tone','input':'Recap these notes for the team: We decided to pause the pilot. Eli will notify the team by Friday.','expected':['With tone guide unavailable, identify references/tone-guide.md and request it; n"]
